        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo SLP-206, 6\" Outswing Door Security Latch Guard Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis security door latch protector is 6\" high and designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building). For use with deadbolts, key-in knobs / levers (door knobs or levers that use a key to unlock) with a rosette (levers round plate)  of 3-3/4\" diameter or smaller. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nProtect your commercial entry doors from tampering and latch prying with this steel security latch protector plate. No special tools required for installation. Available in Silver, Dark Bronze, Chrome plated or Brass Plated.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in Stainless Steel: <a href=\"/products/6-inch-stainless-security-latch-plate-don-jo-slp-106-630\"><b>Don-Jo SLP-106-630 6 Inch Security Latch Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with carriage bolts, washers and acorn cap nuts for safety and strength.  May be used on hollow metal door/frame using ANSI strike.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-SLP-206_size.gif?v=1704354602\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo SLP-206 Security Latch Guard size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNon-Handed, reversible for left or right hand outswinging doors. Fits doors with standard 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo SLP-206 Security Latch Guard:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 12 Gauge (.104\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel </li>\r\n<li>Offset: 3/8\" (.375\") </li>\r\n<li>Lever/Knob Maximum Rosette Diameter: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed (reversible)</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: 2 each carriage bolts, washers and acorn cap nuts</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> -->\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SLP-206.pdf?v=1704262348\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo SLP-206 Security Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
