                "description": "Don-Jo SLP-206 This security door latch protector is 6 inches high and designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building). For use with deadbolts, key-in knobs / levers (door knobs or levers that use a key to unlock) with a rosette (levers round plate)  of 3-3/4 inch diameter or smaller. Available in Silver, Dark Bronze, Chrome plated or Brass Plated.",
